    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structrr_1_1QueueFamilyIndices" kindref="compound">QueueFamilyIndices</ref> is a collection about different Queues that are utilized by the <ref refid="classrr_1_1Renderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structrr_1_1QueueFamilyIndices" kindref="compound">QueueFamilyIndices</ref> stores the handles of a graphics and present Queue family. In addition, it implements several convenience and utility functions.</para>
